# The HTML this site serves (and sw.js's precache list, manifest.webmanifest's
# icon paths) all reference static assets under /assets/... — matching the URL
# scheme continental_backend used to serve this same public/ folder under
# (useStaticAssets prefix: '/assets/'). Rewriting here means none of those
# references needed to change during the Netlify port.
/assets/*  /:splat  200
